# IRONVOW: motes. The first six fights on a floor pay a foe's worth times
# (2 + floor) / 2; the next six pay its plain worth; after that a foe pays
# at most 5. Fights won are counted on the title as BATTLES.
seed 14
game ironvow
cheat newgame 5
cheat fight 0
wait 2
cheat fhp 0 1
cheat fcd 0 999
press A 1
waituntil state == 16 60
expect f_essence == 10
expect battles == 1
expect save_battles == 1
cheat floor 2
cheat fight 0
wait 2
cheat fhp 0 1
cheat fcd 0 999
press A 1
waituntil state == 16 60
expect f_essence == 20
cheat battles 6
cheat fight 0
wait 2
cheat fhp 0 1
cheat fcd 0 999
press A 1
waituntil state == 16 60
expect f_essence == 10
cheat battles 12
cheat fight 3
wait 2
cheat fhp 0 1
cheat fcd 0 999
cheat spell 3
waituntil state == 16 60
expect f_essence == 5
